{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"反复猜得心悬，那份熟悉再温柔地浮起，他只想靠它歇一口气。\",\n          \"key\": \"借着亲切喘息\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"才松开一点，想到它曾远得摸不着，他就舍不得这一刻散去。\",\n          \"key\": \"刚放松便不舍\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段他反复揣摩那一闪究竟是不是回应，心一直悬着。这次熟悉的温柔又浮上来，他首先想要的是从紧张的猜测中缓一口气。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S06-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"先前他曾小心地惦念那份亲切，却强烈觉得它离自己很远。这次好不容易感到亲近，他便格外舍不得片刻的安静过去，怕又只剩远远惦念。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"没在想\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他在反复猜测得心悬之后，又从那份亲切中获得了一次短暂的松快。\",\n        \"先前感到的遥远，使他格外舍不得这片刻的安静。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"上一段悬而不定的猜测直接解释了此刻为何急需喘息，而此前亲切仿佛远去的经历，又让短暂的安慰带上了不舍。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"那份亲切这回像肯向他靠近，他想起自己曾几乎求它回应，心里发热。\",\n          \"key\": \"又像得到回应\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"刚想等它多停一会儿，先前怕认错的疑心又冒出；亲切渐淡，他心口发酸。\",\n          \"key\": \"想信又怕认错\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"他曾因觉得亲切遥远，几乎恳求它主动靠近、给自己一点回应。如今那份熟悉不再只是令人心惊的一闪，而是柔和地停留片刻，先前求回应的心愿便重新热起来。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段他已经想把熟悉感当成靠近的迹象，却始终怕那只是自己的回想。这份顾虑使眼前的温柔难以成为让他放心的回应；刚感到一点亲近又要失去，他便格外酸楚。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"没在想\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"柔和的熟悉感一度使他更想相信，那份亲切正在回应自己。\",\n        \"怕把回想认成回应的疑心，使这次短暂的亲近格外令他心酸。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"此前求回应的心愿和紧接着产生的疑心都有明确前因，能够解释为何同一片刻既带来被亲近的温暖，又因太短、太难确认而令人酸楚。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选2\", \"候选6\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4867797f-e945-4ee9-8138-7754982d0007", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T162042162236Z", "elapsed_seconds": 432.453, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T16:27:54.630204+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d2f406cdc7facc5635efd12db132a605ddebf2d7802e7d254251baf30f88b97e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T162042162236Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8c673f60702f56c5faa93ec8fe648ce5a6a3d